 "notes": "Single OCR'd map sheet with no cross section; map face is OCR noise. OCR misreads: 'QHiw' read as QHfw; 'QHri' read as QHrl (inferred); 'Thickness | to 40 feet' read as 1 (inferred). The Oceda fault is drawn and labelled on the map face (checked on the page overview image); its location is not recorded (never measured from the map). The Bethera Scarp, contact and younger Carolina bay outline are recorded only as legend lines here and not recorded. Pamlico terrace margin elevations (17 and 25 ft) are terrace margins, not unit tops. Rogers (1977) is cited in text but not in the reference list. Drill-hole labels on the map face carry no data. SUBSURFACE: none.",
